<title>BELGIUM: Belgian 2007 OLO auctioned at average 6.114 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian 2007 OLO auctioned at average 6.114 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the following details about the outcome of its monthly auction -</p>
<p>* 6.25 pct, March 2007 OLO</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   100.979 / 6.114 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    100.90 to 101.00</p>
<p>Stop (lowest accepted) price 100.95</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     25</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		  8.100 billion francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	   20.155 billion francs</p>
<p>* 5.00 pct, March 2001 OLO</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   100.950 / 4.745 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    100.80 to 101.00</p>
<p>Stop (lowest accepted) price 100.95</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     100</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		   7.600 billion francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	   16.700 billion francs</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
